INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(1674,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12447864','Extracellular Vesicles Derived From the Feces of Pregnant Women Modulate T Cells Toward a Pregnancy-Supportive Phenotype In Vitro.','Dietz-Ziegler S, Kewitz S, Kaiser G, Rühle J, Marmé A, Dalpke A, Cheaib B, Pauluschke-Fröhlich J, Henes M, Velic A, Pich A, Vollert A, Schaller M, Knab F, Lajqi T, Poets CF, Gille C, Köstlin-Gille N.','2025','bevs cfse carboxyfluorescein succinimidyl lta lipoteiconic rsu1 regs regs regs lipopolysaccharides peptidoglycans penetrative eberhard karls 2022bo1 zymo aliquot ultracentrifugation exoquick nanosight ns300 scmos malvern panalytical malvern thawed nanosight malvern panalytical glow formvar uranyl libra cfse cfse fcs cfse ultracentrifugation cfse cfse spun coverslip ucht1 biolegend alexafluor647 schwerte coverslip apotome axio oberkochen heparinized pancoll panbiotech aidenbach microbeads miltenyi bergisch gladbach rpmi corning kennebunk ccr4 cxcr3 ccr6 ccr4 cxcr3 ccr6 ccr4 cxcr3 ccr6 biolegend cy7 2d1 cy7 hit3a ccr6 g034e3 bv421 a251 ccr4 fitc fab1567f percp rpa cxcr3 1c6 25d2 n49 facscanto flowjo v10 flowjo ashland lipoteichoic lta lta abbexa varioskan lux lysed pmsf bicinchoninic bca polyvinylidenfluoride pvdf biorad feldkirchen nonfat blotted d6a8 nonfat tbst nonfat amersham ibright cl1000 zymobiomics miniprep zymoresearch varioskan lux quantstudio aactcaaakgaattgacgg ctcacrrcacgagctgac bacteroidetes craacaggattagataccct ggtaaggttcctcgcgtat firmicutes ggagyatgtggtttaattcgaagca agctgacgacaaccatgcac gammaproteobacteria tcgtcagctcgtgtygtga cgtaagggccatgatg alphaproteobacteria ciagtgtagaggtgaaatt ccccgtcaattcctttgagtt actinobacteria tacggccgcaaggcta tcrtccccaccttcctccg fusobacteria aagcgcgtctaggtggttatgt tgtagttccgcttacctctccag powerup sybr melting melt quantstudio phylum homemade decontaminated deconseq grch38 hg38 qiime v2023 trimming denoising dada2 qiime derepfastq removebimeradenovo mergepairs asvs makesequencetable mafft fasttree mafft fasttre